# Review categories for Linear's diff view, which groups a pull request's files
# by them (https://linear.app/docs/diffs, "Organize files with .gitattributes").
# Review attributes only; a later line wins. Unmarked files are implementation.

# What agents read as rules or roles.
AGENTS.md review-agent-guidance
bin/brief-template.md review-agent-guidance
packs/*/*.md review-agent-guidance
packs/*/skills/** review-agent-guidance
**/.claude/** review-agent-guidance
kit/.gate/gate-section.md review-agent-guidance
kit/.gate/enforced-rules.md review-agent-guidance
kit/.gate/bin/lib/reviewer-prompt.md review-agent-guidance
**/.claude/**/scripts/** -review-agent-guidance

# Tests and fixtures.
test/** review-test
packs/*/test/** review-test
modules/*/test/** review-test

# Documentation.
NOTICE review-documentation
packs/*/NOTICE review-documentation
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/** review-documentation
kit/.github/pull_request_template.md review-documentation
packs/*/INSTALL.md -review-agent-guidance review-documentation

# Written by a tool, not a person.
kit/.gate/bin/reviewer/package-lock.json review-generated
